<title>FRANCE: Five bombs hit Corsica holiday village, no injuries.</title>
<headline>Five bombs hit Corsica holiday village, no injuries.</headline>
<dateline>AJACCIO, France 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Suspected Corsican separatists exploded five small bombs at a holiday village in the south of the Mediterranean island, gendarmes said on Thursday.</p>
